00:01:43.710 --> 00:01:45.520
which is an absolute nightmare

00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:46.940
for a singer.

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:47.830
So I literally had

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:48.663
to start over

00:01:48.663 --> 00:01:49.496
I couldn't hear--

00:01:49.496 --> 00:01:50.940
- Girl you were still loaded at once

00:01:50.940 --> 00:01:52.540
- I so did yeah.

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:53.450
- That's a lot.

00:01:53.450 --> 00:01:54.750
I didn't even know all of that.

00:01:54.750 --> 00:01:55.583
- I didn't love life

00:01:55.583 --> 00:01:57.170
at that in during that period,

00:01:57.170 --> 00:01:58.003
I have to say

00:01:58.003 --> 00:01:59.040
but so this is why

00:01:59.040 --> 00:02:00.780
life's about to get to get good,

00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:01.730
I was like, Okay,

00:02:01.730 --> 00:02:03.630
come on, you gotta pick yourself up.

00:02:03.630 --> 00:02:04.570
You've got to find

00:02:04.570 --> 00:02:06.333
a way to carry on you have to,

00:02:07.620 --> 00:02:08.453
'cause you're in this like,

00:02:08.453 --> 00:02:09.780
I'm never gonna love again.

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:11.530
I'm never gonna get married again,

00:02:11.530 --> 00:02:12.810
- Yeah.

00:02:12.810 --> 00:02:14.580
Well, you probably shut down a bit.

00:02:14.580 --> 00:02:15.870
It's just for survival.

00:02:15.870 --> 00:02:16.703
- Just felt like I have

00:02:16.703 --> 00:02:17.536
to start from zero

00:02:17.536 --> 00:02:18.940
on so many levels.

00:02:18.940 --> 00:02:20.510
But the voice is

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:24.450
been a real triumph.

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:26.120
experience everything has been,

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:29.420
love has been parenting
has been an absolute joy

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:30.910
and my career is,

00:02:30.910 --> 00:02:32.260
I'm just living my best life right now.

00:02:32.260 --> 00:02:33.650
So I'm not, I don't wanna,

